  "question": "求级数 $1 + \\frac{x^{3}}{3!} + \\frac{x^{6}}{6!} + \\frac{x^{9}}{9!} + \\cdots + \\frac{x^{3n}}{(3n)!} + \\cdots$ 的和函数.",
  "answer": "收敛区间为 $(-∞,+∞)$ .",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "收敛半径与收敛域",
    "级数求和"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 级数通项的分母为阶乘形式，和函数可能会满足某个微分方程。在级数的收敛区间内逐项求导（一阶乃至高阶）并寻找级数与其导数的关系，建立微分方程再求解。"
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "易求得级数的收敛区间为 $(-∞,+∞)$ ."
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "记 $y(x) = 1 + \\frac{x^3}{3!} +\\frac{x^6}{6!} +\\frac{x^9}{9!} +\\dots +\\frac{x^{3n}}{(3n)!} +\\dots$ ，则"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "$$\ny ^ {\\prime} (x) = \\frac {x ^ {2}}{2 !} + \\frac {x ^ {5}}{5 !} + \\frac {x ^ {8}}{8 !} + \\dots + \\frac {x ^ {3 n - 1}}{(3 n - 1) !} + \\dots , \\quad y ^ {\\prime \\prime} (x) = x + \\frac {x ^ {4}}{4 !} + \\frac {x ^ {7}}{7 !} + \\dots + \\frac {x ^ {3 n - 2}}{(3 n - 2) !} + \\dots .\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "有"
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "$$\ny ^ {\\prime \\prime} + y ^ {\\prime} + y = \\sum_ {n = 0} ^ {\\infty} \\frac {x ^ {n}}{n !} = e ^ {x}.\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s7",
        "text": "解初值问题 $\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} y'' + y' + y = e^x \\\\ y(0) = 1, y'(0) = 0 \\end{array} \\right.$ ，得"
      },
      {
        "id": "s8",
        "text": "$$\ny = \\frac {2}{3} e ^ {- \\frac {1}{2} x} \\cos \\frac {\\sqrt {3}}{2} x + \\frac {1}{3} e ^ {x}, \\quad x \\in (- \\infty , + \\infty).\n$$"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "收敛区间为 $(-∞,+∞)$ .",
    "techniques_used": [
      "收敛半径与收敛域",
      "级数求和"
    ]
